<title>USA: TABLE - Arrhythmia Research Q2 net falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Arrhythmia Research Q2 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited, in 000s	  SECOND QUARTER	  SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>   except per share amounts     1997	1996   1997    1996</p>
<p> Revenue			    $ 2,830  $ 6,670$ 6,703 $12,103</p>
<p> Net income				81	139    248     246</p>
<p> Net income per share		 .02	.04    .07     .07</p>
<p> Weighted average shares	  3,563    3,563  3,563   3,592</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q2 revenues fell as 1996 was the final year it acted as the exclusive distributor for the CardioLab (TM) products under its contract with Prucka Engineering Inc.</p>
<p>The decline in net income for the second quarter is due to lower sales in 1997, increased sales and marketing costs, and higher research and development costs.</p>
<p>Arrhythmia Research Technology Inc.</p>
</text>
